%% frame: UC2 B1 to B6 with E1 to E3: redirect, state and Google verification (design)
sequenceDiagram
    actor Buyer
    participant AC as :AuthController
    participant App as :OAuthLoginAppServiceImpl
    participant SS as :OAuthStateStore
    participant GG as :GoogleOAuthGateway
    actor Google

    Note over Buyer,AC: B1: the frontend parks returnTo, then navigates
    Buyer->>AC: googleAuthorize(request)
    AC->>App: createGoogleAuthorizeUrl()
    Note over App,GG: B2
    App->>SS: issueState()
    SS-->>App: IssuedState(state, binding), kept 300 s
    App->>GG: buildAuthorizeUrl(state)
    GG-->>App: Google consent URL
    App-->>AC: GoogleAuthorizeUrl(url, stateBinding)
    AC-->>Buyer: 302 to Google; cookie blocbuy-oauth-state (HttpOnly, Lax)
    Note over Buyer,Google: B3: the buyer signs in and consents at Google
    Note over Buyer,AC: B4: Google redirects the browser back
    Buyer->>AC: googleCallback(code, state, error, stateBinding)
    break error given, or code or state missing (E1)
        AC-->>Buyer: 302 /login?error=IDENTITY_401_003 (or COMMON_400_001)
    end
    AC->>App: loginWithGoogle(code, state, stateBinding)
    Note over App,SS: B5
    App->>SS: consume(state, binding)
    SS-->>App: boolean; GETDEL, so a state works once
    break false (E2)
        App-->>AC: BizException OAUTH_STATE_INVALID (IDENTITY_401_001)
        AC-->>Buyer: 302 /login?error=IDENTITY_401_001
    end
    Note over App,Google: B6: no transaction is open
    App->>GG: exchangeCodeForProfile(code)
    GG->>GG: exchangeCode(code)
    GG->>Google: POST token endpoint (3 s connect, 5 s read)
    Google-->>GG: id_token, or error
    GG->>GG: verify(idToken)
    break unreachable, or token or e-mail not verified (E3)
        GG-->>App: BizException OAUTH_PROVIDER_ERROR or OAUTH_TOKEN_INVALID
        App-->>AC: BizException
        AC-->>Buyer: 302 /login?error=code
    end
    GG-->>App: OAuthProfile, signature, issuer, audience and expiry checked
    Note over App,GG: B7: @fig-a-uc02-ds-login
